{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:12.90]Ooh, woah\n[00:13.36]Uh\n[Verse 1]\n[00:13.42]Bitch, I'm fly as a bird in the Moncler skies (Yeah)\n[00:16.88]Purple hood on my head, ridin' on a dirt bike (Oh yeah)\n[00:20.42]Almost crashed into a turnpike then I turned right (Oh yeah)\n[00:23.70]Remember when I couldn't turn right, I had to learn right (Oh yeah)\n[00:27.34]That's another lesson learned right, I'ma be alright\n[00:30.62]Don't fuck these thots, they'll get you burned right, livin' that dog life\n[00:34.12]Raf Simons and Adidas, but I earn stripes, yeah, you damn right\n[00:37.56]In the airport cuttin' the TSA line, late for my flight, uh (Let's go, let's go)\n[00:42.20]Travel the world, woah, Juice WRLD, glow (Yeah)\n[00:44.92]Triple 9 'til the world blow (Yeah), let your girl know (Yeah)\n[00:48.44]My closet a gun show (Grra), .30 clips and drums, ho (Grra)\n[00:51.90]Don't get Nick Cannon, for my cannon (Yeah), hit a nigga with a drum roll (Get it)\n[Chorus]\n[00:55.62]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah (Yeah)\n[00:57.78]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[01:01.24]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[01:05.04]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[01:09.52]Hit it like yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah (Yeah)\n[01:11.68]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[01:15.44]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[01:18.64]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year, yeah (Bitch, it's cold)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:25.38]Hot in the summertime with a puffer vest still\n[01:28.20]Tuckin' .45's, you could get your shit spilled (Yeah)\n[01:31.86]Banana clip on that Kel-Tec, you can get your shit killed\n[01:34.72](Grra, grra, yeah)\n[01:35.28]I treat your bitch like a secret, I fuck her then that bitch may just get revealed (What else?)\n[01:38.50]She signed me her soul like a record deal (What else?)\n[01:40.12]They say I gave up my soul for a record deal (What else?)\n[01:41.72]You can sell your soul without having record deals (What else?)\n[01:43.76]I ain't sell my soul, feel like it disappeared (Uh)\n[01:45.38]Now I ball 'til I'm bald like I'm Britney Spears (Swish)\n[01:47.06]That lil' bitch a home run, she going, going, gone\n[01:49.52]Get that ho out of here (Yeah)\n[01:50.58]I fuck two of her buddies, they musketeers (Yeah)\n[01:52.28]Choppers on deck, we don't got no muskets here (Yeah)\n[01:54.02]Thankin' God that I made it another year (Yeah)\n[01:55.76]Some of my niggas ain't make it another year (R.I.P)\n[01:57.52]I get high in the sky, in the atmosphere (Yeah)\n[01:59.46]I can't vibe if it ain't no good atmosphere (Yeah)\n[02:00.96]2012 in the clip, yeah, the end is near (Yeah)\n[02:02.74]Twenty shells in his face make him disappear, yeah\n[02:04.94](Grra, grra, grra, grra)\n[Chorus]\n[02:06.50]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah (Yeah)\n[02:24.72]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[02:36.06]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold)\n[02:40.84]Cold outside, it's a Moncler year (Bitch, it's cold), yeah","words":[[12.9,12.98,"Ooh,"],[13.2,13.3,"woah"],[13.36,13.38,"Uh"],[13.42,13.56,"Bitch,"],[13.6,13.7,"I'm"],[13.8,14.22,"fly"],[14.38,14.48,"as"],[14.56,14.56,"a"],[14.72,15.16,"bird"],[15.24,15.32,"in"],[15.38,15.42,"the"],[15.6,16.26,"Moncler"],[16.36,16.74,"skies"],[16.78,16.84,"(Yeah)"],[16.88,17.16,"Purple"],[17.36,17.76,"hood"],[17.84,17.88,"on"],[17.96,18.1,"my"],[18.2,18.48,"head,"],[18.62,19.04,"ridin'"],[19.12,19.26,"on"],[19.32,19.32,"a"],[19.5,19.76,"dirt"],[19.8,19.88,"bike"],[20.04,20.18,"(Oh"],[20.24,20.38,"yeah)"],[20.42,20.74,"Almost"],[20.8,21.2,"crashed"],[21.5,21.64,"into"],[21.74,21.74,"a"],[21.92,22.44,"turnpike"],[22.54,22.68,"then"],[22.84,22.84,"I"],[22.94,23.34,"turned"],[23.38,23.46,"right"],[23.5,23.54,"(Oh"],[23.58,23.64,"yeah)"],[23.7,24.14,"Remember"],[24.3,24.44,"when"],[24.58,24.58,"I"],[24.68,25.08,"couldn't"],[25.12,25.48,"turn"],[25.6,25.78,"right,"],[25.84,25.84,"I"],[26.02,26.2,"had"],[26.24,26.28,"to"],[26.46